### CREATE a new task
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Test Task",
  "status": "Open",
  "priority": "High"
}

### LIST all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### READ a task by ID

GET http://localhost:3000/tasks/<INSERT_ID>

### UPDATE a task

PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/<INSERT_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Test Task",
  "status": "Closed",
  "priority": "Low"
}

### DELETE a task

DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/<INSERT_ID>